      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://snohomishcountywa.gov/5385/Roesiger"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A Washington Department of Fish and Wildlife boat launch sits at the lake’s south end, welcoming anglers and boaters.",
